  summary: Humans' fascination with both mundane things and complex emotions, as
    well as their tendency to complicate simplicity, remains intriguing. Their obsessive
    nature towards numbers, patterns, and mysterious interactions continues to spark
    curiosity, while also introducing subtle hints of potential friendships or motivations,
    warranting further exploration.
  entries:
  - 
  - I wonder what kind of object this human would leave behind if they were in my
    shoes...
  - Why do they always have to leave so suddenly? Can't they see I'm in the middle
    of a fascinating study here?
